styles.body:
{count} commits here are not accounted for (a commit is, once the map holds a commit item for it: type commit, its full sha in sha, a settles link to each item it settles, none when it settles nothing):
{commits}
In your first reply, tell the owner which these are, and make a commit item for each with change (or, where one heard from a push is there already with accounted false, set it true with its links), on the authority you have for it, as you settle what you did. If a commit is not yours to account for, say so.
